  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 705.03 Rule Violations.\n\n(a) The commissioner shall, after an opportunity for hearing as prescribed in Saf-C 200, suspend an officer's commission on finding that an officer has engaged in any activities that constitute a violation of these rules.\n\n(b) Such commission shall be suspended for a period not to exceed one year from the date of hearing.\n\nSource. #2281, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2790, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5067, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6456, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRED: 6-21-97; ss by #6473, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8776, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10889, eff 7-16-15\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nSaf-C 701.01 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 702.01 | RSA 381:2\n\nSaf-C 702.02(a) & (c) | RSA-A 541-A:19-b\n\nSaf-C 702.02(b)(d)(e)(f) | RSA 381:4\n\nSaf-C 702.03 | RSA 381:2\n\nSaf-C 702.04 | RSA 381:4\n\nSaf-C 703.01 | RSA 381:16\n\nSaf-C 703.02 | RSA 541-A:16, I(b)(1)\n\nSaf-C 703.03 & 703.04 | RSA 381:10\n\nSaf-C 704.01 | RSA 541-A:30 & RSA 381:2\n\nSaf-C 704.02 | RSA 381:2\n\nSaf-C 705.01 | RSA 381:2; RSA 381:7 ; RSA 381:12\n\nSaf-C 705.02 | RSA 381:2\n\nSaf-C 705.03 | RSA 541-A:30 & RSA 381:2",
